## 0.5 Logging and Error Handling

- [ ] Define structured log format.
- [ ] Add request correlation IDs.
- [ ] Add centralized frontend error handling.
- [ ] Add backend exception handling strategy.
- [ ] Remove unnecessary sensitive data from logs.
- [ ] Add safe user-facing error messages.
- [ ] Add error-handling tests.

**Suggested commits**
